From 1564432616f457ef32098da7b9f5554b8819491f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ockc <zss@zhengshshdeMacBook-Air.local>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:31:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat: persist AI suggestions with anchors, add insert
 menu and return navigation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ai_suggestion table (V12) replaces the one-shot ai_feedback_cache payload;
  each suggestion keeps paragraph_id/quote_text so it can be located in the body
- generate prompt now asks for paragraphId + verbatim quote, validated against
  the document anchors before persisting; max 4 suggestions per revision
- POST /api/ai-suggestions/{id}/state lets the author or teacher mark
  OPEN/ADOPTED/DISMISSED; AI cards expose 定位正文 and 采纳 with optimistic update
- editor toolbar gains text labels plus a code-block button; the '/' insert hack
  is replaced by a real dropdown menu that also works inside code/figure blocks
- editor heading is no longer a sticky floating card above the toolbar
- 保存草稿 / 提交评审 / 发布正式评价 return to the originating list by default
